00:00:38.461 --> 00:00:40.470
what it does is like
you have A and B.

00:00:40.471 --> 00:00:41.860
They are n by n matrices,

00:00:41.861 --> 00:00:43.375
and you can see a pie,

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:46.220
the set of n by
n permutation matrices,

00:00:46.221 --> 00:00:49.900
and the quadratic assignment
problem ask for the maximum

00:00:49.901 --> 00:00:54.275
among all X in the set of n
by n permutation matrices,

00:00:54.276 --> 00:00:58.600
of the trace of A times
X times B times X transpose.

00:00:58.601 --> 00:01:01.700
This is a quadratic
assignment problem.

00:01:01.701 --> 00:01:04.655
This is a very general problem

00:01:04.656 --> 00:01:06.415
in theoretical computer science,

00:01:06.416 --> 00:01:08.550
and it includes
many relevant problems

00:01:08.551 --> 00:01:10.025
