00:09:38.471 --> 00:09:40.810
similar to
Gromov-Hausdorff distance

00:09:40.811 --> 00:09:43.470
like using optimum transport.

00:09:43.471 --> 00:09:46.345
They call it the
Gromov-Hausdorff distance

00:09:46.346 --> 00:09:50.770
to compare some teeth and they

00:09:50.771 --> 00:09:52.480
use it to use produce a taxonomy

00:09:52.481 --> 00:09:54.360
and like using
the distances between

00:09:54.361 --> 00:09:56.335
